WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.060 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 2=

5
01:39.540 --> 01:39.860
(Santu County Office) Get out!

6
01:50.220 --> 01:51.860
(Santu County Office)

7
01:53.380 --> 01:53.660
Go!

8
01:57.460 --> 01:58.980
(Merit Through the Ages)

9
02:00.900 --> 02:01.780
(It's him.)

10
02:05.340 --> 02:07.580
(He's actually still alive.)

11
02:07.660 --> 02:09.860
(Merit Through the Ages)

12
02:09.860 --> 02:10.620
May I ask, sir,

13
02:11.460 --> 02:13.340
what was the name of the military officer

14
02:13.820 --> 02:14.660
who just rode by?

15
02:14.660 --> 02:15.940
What's it to you?

16
02:16.220 --> 02:17.260
Why are you asking?

17
02:17.860 --> 02:19.180
When I saw him just now,

18
02:19.780 --> 02:20.340
I thought

19
02:21.100 --> 02:22.140
I recognized an old acquaintance of mine.

20
02:23.180 --> 02:23.620
An old acquaintance?

21
02:24.260 --> 02:27.100
Captain Zhang received transfer orders.

22
02:27.220 --> 02:29.420
He's been promoted and is passing through here on his way to the capital.

23
02:29.860 --> 02:31.140
How could he be an old acquaintance of yours?

24
02:32.620 --> 02:33.740
Captain Zhang?

25
02:35.220 --> 02:36.060
His surname is Zhang?

26
02:36.620 --> 02:37.340
You must've mistaken him.

27
02:40.340 --> 02:41.500
The last time I saw him,

28
02:41.780 --> 02:42.980
he was still in the Shence Army.

29
02:43.620 --> 02:44.300
I never imagined

30
02:45.100 --> 02:45.660
that now,

31
02:46.980 --> 02:48.300
he'd have such a bright future.

32
02:56.260 --> 02:56.980
Sanlang!

33
02:57.300 --> 02:58.820
Dalang, Shang, run!

34
03:01.420 --> 03:01.860
Father!

35
03:07.540 --> 03:08.260
(Xie Jinghui, Yan Shang's Mother)

36
03:09.260 --> 03:10.260
Jinghui!

37
03:10.420 --> 03:10.780
Mother!

38
03:11.260 --> 03:13.220
(Young Yan Shang)

39
03:20.460 --> 03:21.820
(Come have a look!)

40
03:22.300 --> 03:24.260
(Candied hawthorns!)

41
03:24.260 --> 03:25.380
(Come and see!)

42
03:25.860 --> 03:27.500
(Tasty and affordable!)

43
03:29.220 --> 03:30.580
(Top quality! Take a look!)

44
03:33.500 --> 03:34.780
(Meat) (Come have a look!)

45
03:34.980 --> 03:37.300
(Finely crafted, sturdy and durable!)

46
03:37.340 --> 03:37.820
(Take care.)

47
03:39.980 --> 03:41.140
(Come have a look!)

48
03:41.140 --> 03:42.500
(Everything's freshly made!)

49
03:42.740 --> 03:43.940
(Promoted to a post in the capital...)

50
03:45.860 --> 03:47.140
(So, he's going to Sheng'an.)

51
03:49.180 --> 03:50.740
(Sheng'an...)

52
03:51.900 --> 03:53.900
(Shuying Rouge House) (Ladies, feel free to browse here too.)

53
03:55.300 --> 03:56.140
(Come have a look!)

54
03:57.100 --> 03:58.700
This is the most fashionable shade.

55
03:58.980 --> 04:01.020
Don't apply it all over. Just dab it on that spot.

56
04:01.420 --> 04:02.660
What brings a man here?

57
04:03.340 --> 04:04.060
Don't bother looking.

58
04:04.420 --> 04:05.780
He's obviously here to buy makeup.

59
04:06.060 --> 04:07.140
He must already have a wife.

60
04:08.100 --> 04:10.380
How come other women's husbands know what to buy?

61
04:10.980 --> 04:11.780
Sir,

62
04:12.380 --> 04:13.260
what can I get for you?

63
04:14.700 --> 04:15.740
Are these all the rouge shades

64
04:16.140 --> 04:16.780
you have?

65
04:29.460 --> 04:31.140
You're quite a picky young man.

66
04:31.580 --> 04:33.100
(Sappan Rouge) All our shades in storage are here.

67
04:33.500 --> 04:34.100
You won't find

68
04:34.100 --> 04:35.620
a wider range of shades anywhere else.

69
04:54.700 --> 04:55.100
I want this one.

70
04:55.780 --> 04:57.740
Sir, don't mind me saying so,

71
04:58.220 --> 05:00.140
but this shade isn't very fashionable.

72
05:00.700 --> 05:02.500
It sold well a few years ago.

73
05:02.860 --> 05:04.020
But nowadays...

74
05:10.340 --> 05:10.620
Here.

75
05:11.780 --> 05:12.060
Oh...

76
05:14.220 --> 05:16.540
A box of rouge doesn't cost this much.

77
05:16.980 --> 05:17.980
I'm not buying this box of rouge.

78
05:18.660 --> 05:19.380
I just want to know

79
05:20.020 --> 05:21.060
how rouge in this shade

80
05:21.620 --> 05:22.420
is made.

81
05:22.700 --> 05:23.780
Well...

82
05:25.340 --> 05:26.100
Sir,

83
05:26.380 --> 05:28.140
don't underestimate women's cosmetics.

84
05:28.580 --> 05:29.780
They're quite complicated to make.

85
05:29.860 --> 05:31.140
The techniques are hard to learn and remember.

86
05:32.380 --> 05:33.140
Just teach me, miss.

87
05:33.620 --> 05:34.180
I'll remember

88
05:34.660 --> 05:35.220
and learn how to make it.

89
05:35.860 --> 05:36.820
Well...

90
05:50.780 --> 05:51.700
Are you resting, my lady?

91
05:52.540 --> 05:53.180
What is it?

92
05:55.340 --> 05:56.660
I've come to apologize to you.

93
05:59.340 --> 05:59.860
Come in.

94
06:10.420 --> 06:12.140
You really know when to swallow your pride.

95
06:13.340 --> 06:14.700
I slapped you this morning,

96
06:15.420 --> 06:16.380
and by tonight, you're over it?

97
06:18.100 --> 06:18.780
Not over it.

98
06:19.460 --> 06:20.060
I understand now.

99
06:21.220 --> 06:23.580
That rouge must've meant a lot to you.

100
06:24.420 --> 06:25.540
I can't truly understand how you feel.

101
06:27.060 --> 06:27.540
This morning,

102
06:28.100 --> 06:29.460
you weren't just angry.

103
06:30.180 --> 06:30.900
You were hurt, too.

104
06:32.820 --> 06:33.740
Why are you telling me all this?

105
06:35.340 --> 06:36.620
Want another slap?

106
06:46.700 --> 06:47.220
What's this?

107
06:48.180 --> 06:49.100
Tools for making rouge.

108
06:49.860 --> 06:51.060
I remember the shade of that rouge.

109
06:51.940 --> 06:52.860
It was the color of crimson clouds.

110
06:53.860 --> 06:54.460
I want to try making some

111
06:55.180 --> 06:55.860
and make you a new box of rouge.

112
07:00.220 --> 07:01.180
You know how to make rouge?

113
07:20.700 --> 07:24.840
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft and sweet♪

114
07:24.840 --> 07:29.140
♪Fireflies dance freely through the night♪

115
07:29.260 --> 07:32.980
♪Chasing the beauty of this fleeting world♪

116
07:32.980 --> 07:37.500
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

117
07:37.580 --> 07:41.440
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

118
07:41.440 --> 07:45.900
♪Their songs linger through the passing years♪

119
07:46.300 --> 07:50.320
♪Life is but a fleeting stay♪

120
07:50.320 --> 07:54.100
♪How lucky I am to walk this path with you♪

121
07:54.860 --> 07:59.040
♪Playing out life's game, forever by your side♪

122
07:59.040 --> 08:02.980
♪Innocent through the years♪

123
08:03.460 --> 08:06.980
♪I thought time might stand still♪

124
08:06.980 --> 08:10.860
♪Forever at that crossroads♪

125
08:11.980 --> 08:15.620
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade♪

126
08:15.700 --> 08:19.700
♪Weathering life's rise and fall♪

127
08:20.380 --> 08:24.300
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness♪

128
08:24.300 --> 08:28.540
♪Is starlight caught in your eyes♪

129
08:33.780 --> 08:34.100
Is it right?

130
08:34.700 --> 08:35.060
It's close.

131
08:35.660 --> 08:36.220
Very close.

132
09:05.180 --> 09:05.540
No, that's not right.

133
09:06.420 --> 09:07.740
The shade is a little too light.

134
09:09.540 --> 09:09.860
No.

135
09:12.260 --> 09:13.820
When it was freshly made,

136
09:15.140 --> 09:16.180
it was exactly this color.

137
09:21.580 --> 09:23.020
The rouge that was destroyed

138
09:25.540 --> 09:26.500
was made by my mother

139
09:28.260 --> 09:29.620
with her own hands.

140
09:31.820 --> 09:32.940
It was the only keepsake

141
09:34.660 --> 09:35.780
she left me.

142
09:46.660 --> 09:47.180
Yan Shang,

143
09:47.940 --> 09:48.540
thank you.

144
09:49.700 --> 09:50.940
How can I ever thank you?

145
09:59.260 --> 10:00.180
Don't rush to answer.

146
10:01.180 --> 10:02.100
Give it some thought.

147
10:20.940 --> 10:21.620
What happened

148
10:22.300 --> 10:23.220
to your face?

149
10:27.460 --> 10:28.260
A branch scratched me.

150
10:29.380 --> 10:29.740
No.

151
10:30.620 --> 10:31.580
It's a whip mark.

152
10:32.900 --> 10:34.140
Again, you're not telling me the truth.

153
10:39.820 --> 10:40.700
I ran into someone

154
10:41.660 --> 10:42.220
on the road today.

155
10:43.580 --> 10:44.700
He whipped me once.

156
10:51.460 --> 10:52.300
Does it still hurt?

157
11:17.540 --> 11:18.140
It's late.

158
11:19.980 --> 11:20.460
My lady,

159
11:22.260 --> 11:23.020
you should get some rest.

160
11:42.060 --> 11:42.980
You're finally back, huh?

161
11:47.140 --> 11:48.300
Why are you still awake, Father?

162
11:48.420 --> 11:49.500
You're still awake too, aren't you?

163
11:51.260 --> 11:53.460
Busy making rouge for that woman.

164
12:35.060 --> 12:36.940
You grew up steeped in books,

165
12:37.860 --> 12:40.220
yet you fawn over that woman.

166
12:40.500 --> 12:41.740
Have you no shame?

167
12:50.540 --> 12:50.860
Yes.

168
12:52.380 --> 12:53.420
I am fawning over her.

169
12:56.660 --> 12:57.020
You...

170
12:58.860 --> 13:00.220
Have you no shame?

171
13:04.020 --> 13:04.420
Father,

172
13:05.940 --> 13:06.820
I want to leave here

173
13:07.660 --> 13:08.300
and go to Sheng'an.

174
13:08.980 --> 13:09.900
She's an honored guest from Sheng'an.

175
13:09.900 --> 13:11.100
She can give me that opportunity.

176
13:32.020 --> 13:33.980
You're nothing but a country bumpkin.

177
13:35.420 --> 13:37.900
You think you'll make a name for yourself in Sheng'an?

178
13:40.060 --> 13:41.460
You think groveling at her feet

179
13:41.460 --> 13:42.700
will send you soaring through the ranks?

180
13:48.620 --> 13:50.060
It's better than doing nothing.

181
13:50.900 --> 13:52.220
Better than pretending to live in seclusion

182
13:53.060 --> 13:54.140
when you're really just running away.

183
13:54.500 --> 13:55.700
Better than living like you,

184
13:56.820 --> 13:58.500
hiding in this wretched backwater your whole life,

185
13:58.500 --> 13:59.940
shutting out the world like a coward!

186
14:08.620 --> 14:09.060
Get out!

187
14:10.100 --> 14:10.460
Father,

188
14:11.380 --> 14:12.060
don't be angry.

189
14:12.340 --> 14:13.340
Shang isn't like that.

190
14:13.340 --> 14:13.780
Silence!

191
14:14.740 --> 14:16.140
Want to get out with him too?

192
14:24.500 --> 14:25.020
Shang...

193
15:26.860 --> 15:27.300
Brother.

194
15:30.060 --> 15:30.500
What's wrong?

195
15:41.340 --> 15:41.740
Thank you.

196
15:44.820 --> 15:47.220
Brother, why do you suddenly want to go to Sheng'an?

197
15:47.860 --> 15:48.740
It's not like you.

198
15:51.820 --> 15:52.700
What am I like, then?

199
15:55.100 --> 15:55.780
You're clever

200
15:56.340 --> 15:57.380
but stubborn to a fault.

201
15:58.100 --> 15:58.860
You're even-tempered,

202
15:59.300 --> 16:00.100
yet you worry too much.

203
16:01.060 --> 16:02.500
You seem to want nothing,

204
16:02.700 --> 16:03.900
yet something weighs on your mind.

205
16:04.860 --> 16:07.100
And I don't know what it is.

206
16:10.140 --> 16:10.620
Xiaozhou,

207
16:11.700 --> 16:12.380
if one day

208
16:12.940 --> 16:13.860
I leave Lingnan,

209
16:14.740 --> 16:15.980
the whole family will be counting on you.

210
16:16.220 --> 16:16.940
You're leaving?

211
16:19.900 --> 16:21.700
If anyone comes looking for the lady later,

212
16:21.860 --> 16:22.460
whatever they ask,

213
16:22.740 --> 16:23.420
just say you don't know.

214
16:25.260 --> 16:25.580
All right.

215
16:26.260 --> 16:26.700
I understand.

216
16:31.740 --> 16:32.500
The officers have been searching

217
16:32.500 --> 16:33.940
all over the hills since early morning.

218
16:34.460 --> 16:35.700
They'll probably find this place soon.

219
16:36.340 --> 16:36.700
Your Highness,

220
16:37.260 --> 16:38.260
something about this doesn't add up.

221
16:38.820 --> 16:39.700
Lingnan is full of hills and forests.

222
16:40.180 --> 16:41.100
We've already hidden ourselves here.

223
16:41.460 --> 16:42.260
How did they find us again?

224
16:42.900 --> 16:44.980
Those men are like flies.

225
16:45.620 --> 16:46.420
You can't get rid of them.

226
16:46.820 --> 16:47.260
Shall we see them?

227
16:47.740 --> 16:48.260
No.

228
16:48.540 --> 16:48.820
All right.

229
16:49.220 --> 16:49.980
I'll move the carriage.

230
16:57.540 --> 16:57.900
Your Honor,

231
16:58.180 --> 16:58.460
over there!

232
16:58.900 --> 16:59.740
There's a house over there, too!

233
17:01.300 --> 17:01.820
Careful.

234
17:10.540 --> 17:11.140
Anyone home?

235
17:18.300 --> 17:20.020
I'm Zheng Chengqing, magistrate of Santu County.

236
17:21.060 --> 17:21.540
Sorry to intrude.

237
17:31.540 --> 17:32.060
Young man,

238
17:32.700 --> 17:34.580
is there an honored guest staying here?

239
17:35.460 --> 17:35.780
Yes.

240
17:36.620 --> 17:38.260
But the lady left this morning.

241
17:38.860 --> 17:39.540
If you don't believe me,

242
17:40.260 --> 17:41.940
check the carriage tracks at my door.

243
17:47.660 --> 17:48.060
Your Honor!

244
17:48.620 --> 17:48.900
There...

245
17:49.340 --> 17:50.260
there are carriage tracks!

246
17:56.300 --> 17:57.700
After crossing all these hills,

247
17:57.700 --> 17:58.620
we finally found this place,

248
17:59.420 --> 18:00.380
only to be one step too late.

249
18:07.700 --> 18:08.620
Your Honor, have some water.

250
18:09.180 --> 18:09.820
No, no.

251
18:10.700 --> 18:11.460
Chengqing!

252
18:16.540 --> 18:17.700
Chengqing.

253
18:20.500 --> 18:21.300
Careful.

254
18:30.940 --> 18:31.980
Yan Zhanzhi!

255
18:32.260 --> 18:34.300
Chengqing, after decades apart,

256
18:34.300 --> 18:35.540
I never imagined

257
18:35.660 --> 18:37.220
we'd live to meet again.

258
18:45.340 --> 18:46.020
Zhanzhi,

259
18:47.020 --> 18:48.580
I never thought we'd meet again either.

260
18:49.740 --> 18:51.900
Back then, you were renowned throughout the capital.

261
18:52.300 --> 18:55.260
Your talent far surpassed ours.

262
18:56.580 --> 18:57.420
(So his father)

263
18:57.820 --> 19:00.260
(is Yan Zhanzhi, the famous scholar of his day.)

264
19:01.420 --> 19:03.300
(Back then, he placed third in the palace exam,)

265
19:03.740 --> 19:05.060
(and married a noble lady of the Xie family.)

266
19:05.740 --> 19:06.540
(Now...)

267
19:07.060 --> 19:08.300
(he's ended up in Lingnan.)

268
19:08.740 --> 19:09.740
To be frank,

269
19:10.420 --> 19:12.940
my son is now registered in the Capital Prefecture

270
19:13.540 --> 19:14.740
and is preparing for the imperial exams.

271
19:15.300 --> 19:16.300
Look at your sons.

272
19:17.380 --> 19:19.180
They've become nothing but country bumpkins!

273
19:20.900 --> 19:21.540
Then again,

274
19:22.140 --> 19:23.980
your whole family ended up here,

275
19:23.980 --> 19:25.060
without household registration all these years, right?

276
19:25.660 --> 19:26.940
So you can't sit for the imperial exams.

277
19:29.740 --> 19:30.060
Father.

278
19:30.860 --> 19:31.140
Father.

279
19:31.340 --> 19:32.220
- How did I not notice? - Easy.

280
19:32.220 --> 19:33.420
You're paralyzed!

281
19:34.100 --> 19:36.020
You're not even whole anymore.

282
19:36.460 --> 19:37.740
You smug little upstart!

283
19:39.380 --> 19:39.900
Chengqing!

284
19:40.300 --> 19:40.620
Brother.

285
19:40.620 --> 19:41.700
- You... - Take Father back to his room to rest.

286
19:41.700 --> 19:42.140
- All right. - Father!

287
19:42.140 --> 19:42.780
I'll see to Uncle Zheng.

288
19:42.780 --> 19:43.140
Father!

289
19:43.700 --> 19:44.100
Shang!

290
19:44.180 --> 19:44.860
Xiaozhou, go back, too.

291
19:44.900 --> 19:46.180
- What a hypocrite! - Father!

292
19:46.180 --> 19:46.540
Steady now.

293
19:46.540 --> 19:47.340
You contemptible wretch,

294
19:47.460 --> 19:49.060
always currying favor with the powerful!

295
19:49.060 --> 19:49.740
Enough, Father.

296
19:49.820 --> 19:50.820
You hypocrite!

297
19:50.820 --> 19:51.540
Say no more.

298
19:51.540 --> 19:53.300
You hypocrite!

299
19:56.780 --> 19:58.580
You'll meet a bad end!

300
19:58.820 --> 19:59.620
Uncle, I'm sorry about that.

301
20:02.740 --> 20:04.060
You're over fifty now, aren't you?

302
20:05.540 --> 20:06.580
And you've become a county magistrate.

303
20:07.260 --> 20:08.980
They say success comes to the young.

304
20:09.380 --> 20:09.980
But I don't think so.

305
20:11.100 --> 20:12.740
Take you, for example. You're no longer young,

306
20:13.380 --> 20:13.900
yet you've finally found success.

307
20:14.500 --> 20:15.620
Shouldn't we congratulate you?

308
20:17.220 --> 20:17.980
Congratulations!

309
20:23.300 --> 20:24.300
Who do you think you are?

310
20:24.860 --> 20:26.260
A family of unregistered vagrants!

311
20:27.940 --> 20:28.700
Uncle, you're right.

312
20:29.540 --> 20:30.540
We're indeed wanderers

313
20:30.980 --> 20:31.780
under no one's jurisdiction.

314
20:32.740 --> 20:34.300
But you're an official now,

315
20:34.820 --> 20:36.220
subject to the court's annual evaluations.

316
20:37.620 --> 20:39.980
You'd best not associate with us

317
20:39.980 --> 20:40.820
country bumpkins.

318
20:41.700 --> 20:43.380
Wouldn't want to tarnish your reputation as an official.

319
20:50.460 --> 20:51.100
Safe travels, Uncle.

320
20:53.900 --> 20:55.740
Wait, what are you up to?

321
20:55.940 --> 20:57.260
You swore up and down and brought us here.

322
20:57.580 --> 20:58.300
How dare you make a fool of me?

323
21:01.300 --> 21:01.700
Sir,

324
21:02.620 --> 21:04.180
your magistrate is long gone.

325
21:14.700 --> 21:15.780
So you led them here?

326
21:48.700 --> 21:49.420
So,

327
21:50.820 --> 21:51.780
you know who I am.

328
21:53.460 --> 21:54.140
I was only guessing.

329
21:56.540 --> 21:57.700
You're that scared of me?

330
21:58.660 --> 21:59.620
That sick of me?

331
22:00.660 --> 22:02.300
So afraid I'll stay one more day

332
22:03.220 --> 22:04.860
that you're racking your brains to get rid of me?

333
22:05.460 --> 22:05.940
Yan Shang,

334
22:06.780 --> 22:08.300
you've got some nerve!

335
22:09.780 --> 22:11.540
No one's ever dared treat me this way.

336
22:14.660 --> 22:15.140
I'm sorry.

337
22:16.340 --> 22:17.500
I was already regretting it yesterday.

338
22:17.940 --> 22:18.980
Your regret means nothing to me!

339
22:23.300 --> 22:24.620
For the sake of this box of rouge,

340
22:27.020 --> 22:27.780
I'll forgive you.

341
22:28.620 --> 22:29.140
And what's more,

342
22:30.020 --> 22:30.940
I'll grant your wish.

343
22:36.620 --> 22:37.020
Chunhua.

344
22:37.580 --> 22:39.140
Tell them to pack and prepare to leave.

345
23:41.940 --> 23:42.700
Now I understand

346
23:43.860 --> 23:46.380
why you want to leave Lingnan.

347
23:50.220 --> 23:50.620
Father...

348
23:55.420 --> 23:56.820
You were right that night.

349
23:58.980 --> 24:00.220
I've hidden away here for years,

350
24:01.700 --> 24:03.020
as good as dead.

351
24:04.540 --> 24:06.540
Dalang is simple-minded now

352
24:07.380 --> 24:09.340
and is destined to live out his days in the countryside.

353
24:11.260 --> 24:12.380
As your father,

354
24:14.140 --> 24:16.100
I've failed you both.

355
24:18.860 --> 24:20.100
And Xiaozhou has had a hard time, too.

356
24:30.180 --> 24:30.580
Father,

357
24:31.340 --> 24:32.580
actually, I envy my elder brother.

358
24:34.380 --> 24:35.180
He told me

359
24:36.620 --> 24:38.020
when the rice ears emerge,

360
24:38.700 --> 24:39.260
he's happy.

361
24:40.420 --> 24:41.380
Happy when it rains

362
24:41.740 --> 24:42.300
and cools down.

363
24:43.860 --> 24:45.020
Happy when Xiaozhou

364
24:46.020 --> 24:46.740
cooks something good.

365
24:48.540 --> 24:49.060
Once,

366
24:49.780 --> 24:51.580
he caught a beautiful dragonfly for me

367
24:53.100 --> 24:54.100
and was happy for ages.

368
24:56.580 --> 24:57.900
To eat one's fill and roam freely.

369
24:59.300 --> 25:01.660
That's the ideal the sage Zhuangzi pursued all his life.

370
25:02.660 --> 25:03.540
My elder brother has achieved it.

371
25:09.940 --> 25:10.740
I'm far from his equal.

372
25:12.380 --> 25:13.460
With desires in my heart,

373
25:14.500 --> 25:15.460
I only torment myself.

374
25:25.220 --> 25:26.740
With the talent to achieve great things,

375
25:27.980 --> 25:29.700
how can you not aspire to soar like a roc?

376
25:30.740 --> 25:31.700
Sheng'an may be far away,

377
25:32.740 --> 25:33.460
but you can make it there.

378
25:37.100 --> 25:38.460
You've thought this through better than I have.

379
25:40.060 --> 25:40.900
Whatever you want to do,

380
25:43.140 --> 25:43.820
go ahead and do it.

381
26:03.020 --> 26:03.580
(I wonder)

382
26:05.020 --> 26:06.220
(where she is now.)

383
26:13.060 --> 26:14.580
So much for Lingxi's fine wine.

384
26:14.860 --> 26:15.580
It's nothing special.

385
26:23.420 --> 26:24.420
My lady, headache again?

386
26:25.180 --> 26:26.300
Did you sleep poorly last night?

387
26:40.500 --> 26:41.060
What's wrong?

388
26:41.700 --> 26:42.580
My lady, don't get out.

389
26:43.380 --> 26:44.260
There seems to be a wild beast nearby.

390
26:58.460 --> 26:58.940
(Watch out!)

391
26:58.940 --> 26:59.460
(Watch out!)

392
26:59.460 --> 27:00.220
(Hold the carriage steady!)

393
27:00.300 --> 27:00.700
(Back away!)

394
27:00.700 --> 27:01.180
(Watch out!)

395
27:02.820 --> 27:03.300
Your Highness!

396
27:03.340 --> 27:03.980
Your Highness!

397
28:23.780 --> 28:24.220
I'm fine.

398
28:27.580 --> 28:27.900
It's nothing.

399
28:28.300 --> 28:29.220
When the tutor asks about it later,

400
28:29.420 --> 28:29.820
just say

401
28:30.260 --> 28:31.420
his cat broke it.

402
28:33.660 --> 28:34.340
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice) What happened just now?

403
28:35.820 --> 28:36.340
Nothing.

404
28:36.860 --> 28:38.380
My heart suddenly skipped a beat.

405
28:39.220 --> 28:40.220
Perhaps I didn't sleep well last night.

406
28:40.580 --> 28:44.460
(Learning without thought is labor lost; thought without learning is perilous.)

407
28:44.460 --> 28:44.900
Shang,

408
28:45.700 --> 28:46.460
am I seeing things?

409
28:47.060 --> 28:48.820
If I didn't know you were a bachelor,

410
28:49.740 --> 28:52.100
I'd think you'd been mooning over a girl all day.

411
28:54.460 --> 28:55.580
The results are posted tomorrow.

412
28:55.980 --> 28:56.660
At a time like this,

413
28:57.060 --> 28:58.300
you still have time to tease me.

414
28:59.140 --> 28:59.900
It's only the local qualifying exam.

415
29:00.300 --> 29:01.100
It's not worth worrying over.

416
29:02.180 --> 29:03.340
My name will definitely

417
29:04.380 --> 29:05.100
be on the list.

418
29:07.420 --> 29:07.820
That's true.

419
29:08.780 --> 29:09.180
When it comes

420
29:09.740 --> 29:11.020
to poetry and rhapsody, classical interpretation, or policy essays,

421
29:11.980 --> 29:13.340
no one can match you.

422
29:13.780 --> 29:15.060
Even if Lingnan selects only one candidate,

423
29:15.660 --> 29:16.340
it'll surely be you.

424
29:18.820 --> 29:19.180
Shang,

425
29:19.940 --> 29:20.300
you're wrong.

426
29:20.780 --> 29:21.940
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice) The people in these schools

427
29:22.100 --> 29:23.700
are all mediocre nobodies.

428
29:24.020 --> 29:25.340
They're not even worth comparing to me.

429
29:25.820 --> 29:27.100
But in classical interpretation and policy essays,

430
29:27.620 --> 29:28.580
isn't there someone right here

431
29:29.300 --> 29:30.380
who can match me?

432
29:30.860 --> 29:32.300
If only you had household registration...

433
29:36.460 --> 29:37.300
Well, Wenji,

434
29:38.060 --> 29:39.260
you know every subject there is

435
29:39.500 --> 29:40.100
except common decency.

436
29:40.700 --> 29:41.380
A few words in,

437
29:42.060 --> 29:43.180
and you're already reopening my old wounds.

438
29:47.940 --> 29:48.660
There'll be a way.

439
29:53.700 --> 29:54.380
That's right.

440
29:56.180 --> 29:57.260
There'll be a way.

441
30:06.020 --> 30:06.420
(Your Highness?)

442
30:06.620 --> 30:07.500
