455
30:25.220 --> 30:25.780
(Your Highness?)

456
30:26.260 --> 30:26.940
(To the left! Hurry!)

457
30:27.100 --> 30:27.900
- (My lady?) - (My lady?)

458
30:28.660 --> 30:29.900
- (My lady?) - (Where are you?)

459
30:29.900 --> 30:30.460
(My lady?)

460
30:30.700 --> 30:31.460
(My lady?)

461
30:31.460 --> 30:31.980
(Search over there!)

462
30:31.980 --> 30:32.540
Fang Tong,

463
30:33.460 --> 30:34.460
what do we do?

464
30:35.020 --> 30:35.340
No.

465
30:35.340 --> 30:36.020
(Come on!)

466
30:36.300 --> 30:36.940
We must notify the authorities

467
30:37.420 --> 30:38.260
and get more people to help search.

468
30:38.780 --> 30:39.700
But my lady forbade it.

469
30:40.100 --> 30:40.420
(Careful!)

470
30:40.420 --> 30:41.300
As long as we find her,

471
30:41.660 --> 30:42.620
I'll accept any punishment.

472
30:42.860 --> 30:43.300
(Everyone, lend a hand!)

473
30:43.300 --> 30:44.580
We must find her before dark.

474
30:45.060 --> 30:46.300
Once night falls in these wild woods,

475
30:46.700 --> 30:47.500
there'll be beasts everywhere.

476
30:49.140 --> 30:49.700
(Come on, give it here!)

477
30:49.900 --> 30:51.020
You two, search over there!

478
30:51.020 --> 30:51.300
(Careful!)

479
30:51.500 --> 30:51.820
- Yes! - Yes!

480
32:12.940 --> 32:13.780
(The carriage fell in.)

481
32:14.420 --> 32:15.380
(It would've drifted downstream.)

482
32:16.620 --> 32:17.620
(If I head upstream,)

483
32:18.700 --> 32:20.220
(I might find where it fell in.)

484
33:07.900 --> 33:09.260
(My lady?)

485
33:10.020 --> 33:11.060
(My lady?)

486
33:11.060 --> 33:11.580
(Search carefully!)

487
33:12.020 --> 33:12.820
(My lady?)

488
33:14.020 --> 33:14.380
Sir,

489
33:14.820 --> 33:15.460
what happened?

490
33:15.540 --> 33:16.020
We're looking for the lady.

491
33:16.020 --> 33:17.620
- (My lady?) - (My lady?)

492
33:17.700 --> 33:18.980
(My lady?)

493
33:18.980 --> 33:20.100
(Why don't we check over there?)

494
33:20.340 --> 33:21.100
- (All right.) - (No sign of her here!)

495
33:21.380 --> 33:22.300
My lady?

496
33:22.300 --> 33:23.380
(My lady?)

497
33:23.420 --> 33:24.060
- (My lady?) - (My lady?)

498
33:24.060 --> 33:26.460
- My lady, where are you? - (My lady?)

499
33:26.980 --> 33:27.660
(Hurry! Search carefully!)

500
33:27.980 --> 33:28.780
(My lady?)

501
33:28.980 --> 33:29.620
Miss Chunhua!

502
33:29.620 --> 33:31.100
- (My lady?) - (My lady?)

503
33:31.100 --> 33:31.500
What happened?

504
33:32.540 --> 33:33.260
Where's your lady?

505
33:33.500 --> 33:34.100
Yan Shang...

506
33:34.820 --> 33:35.820
(My lady?)

507
33:35.980 --> 33:37.940
My lady is missing.

508
33:37.940 --> 33:38.380
Missing?

509
33:39.140 --> 33:39.700
How did she go missing?

510
33:39.820 --> 33:41.180
A tiger spooked the horses

511
33:41.620 --> 33:44.460
and the carriage overturned and fell into the river...

512
33:45.580 --> 33:46.460
My lady?

513
33:47.100 --> 33:47.900
When did this happen?

514
33:48.660 --> 33:51.060
It's been most of the day.

515
33:52.980 --> 33:53.940
(My lady?)

516
33:54.340 --> 33:55.220
(Search thoroughly!)

517
33:55.220 --> 33:55.940
(Check over there!)

518
33:55.940 --> 33:56.540
(No slacking off!)

519
33:57.020 --> 33:57.780
(My lady?)

520
33:57.780 --> 33:58.100
Sir,

521
33:58.700 --> 33:59.220
this isn't the way to search.

522
33:59.220 --> 34:00.380
You again?

523
34:00.820 --> 34:01.540
It's been hours since the accident.

524
34:01.660 --> 34:02.460
She's probably injured.

525
34:02.940 --> 34:03.820
Her voice must be weak.

526
34:04.380 --> 34:05.460
With everyone shouting at once,

527
34:05.820 --> 34:07.140
we wouldn't hear her even if she cried for help.

528
34:07.620 --> 34:07.980
Besides,

529
34:08.500 --> 34:09.340
night is falling.

530
34:09.780 --> 34:10.540
She has no torch.

531
34:10.780 --> 34:11.780
All this torchlight in our eyes...

532
34:11.780 --> 34:12.500
My lady?

533
34:12.500 --> 34:14.140
... will make it even harder to see through the woods.

534
34:14.380 --> 34:16.580
Are you telling me how to do my job?

535
34:17.620 --> 34:19.380
Right now, finding her is our top priority.

536
34:19.380 --> 34:19.940
Then move aside!

537
34:20.300 --> 34:21.260
Don't interfere with official business!

538
34:21.900 --> 34:23.140
Walk through the woods without a torch?

539
34:23.140 --> 34:23.940
Do I have a death wish?

540
34:24.380 --> 34:25.540
Aren't you carrying one yourself?

541
34:26.100 --> 34:27.020
And you're lecturing me?

542
34:27.740 --> 34:28.940
Search carefully!

543
34:29.540 --> 34:30.820
The sooner we find her,

544
34:31.260 --> 34:32.740
the sooner we can go home!

545
34:32.740 --> 34:33.260
(Don't die.)

546
34:33.460 --> 34:33.780
(Yes!)

547
34:33.860 --> 34:34.460
(My lady?)

548
34:38.180 --> 34:39.340
(No slacking! Search carefully!)

549
34:39.340 --> 34:40.100
(My lady?)

550
34:40.220 --> 34:41.140
(My lady?)

551
34:41.780 --> 34:42.060
(Hurry!)

552
34:47.660 --> 34:49.420
- (My lady?) - (My lady?)

553
37:43.620 --> 37:44.820
Mother...

554
37:46.580 --> 37:52.700
♪A daughter ventures forth, in the name her father gave♪

555
37:53.100 --> 37:59.100
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

556
37:59.220 --> 37:59.940
Mother...

557
38:02.140 --> 38:03.060
Mother...

558
38:03.060 --> 38:06.820
♪The fate is sealed, a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

559
38:07.540 --> 38:11.080
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

560
38:11.080 --> 38:14.620
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

561
38:15.260 --> 38:18.740
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

562
38:18.740 --> 38:22.300
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

563
38:22.740 --> 38:23.740
(Wanyao, don't cry.)

564
38:23.740 --> 38:27.700
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

565
38:27.700 --> 38:28.860
(My Wanyao,)

566
38:30.340 --> 38:31.540
(you're the bravest, aren't you?)

567
38:31.540 --> 38:34.060
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

568
38:34.180 --> 38:35.620
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

569
38:35.620 --> 38:35.940
(Come on.)

570
38:36.860 --> 38:38.860
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

571
38:38.860 --> 38:39.620
(Have a piece of candy.)

572
38:40.820 --> 38:44.180
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

573
38:44.300 --> 38:48.420
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

574
38:48.700 --> 38:51.060
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

575
38:51.260 --> 38:54.260
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

576
38:54.460 --> 38:57.500
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

577
38:58.220 --> 39:02.260
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

578
39:02.780 --> 39:05.580
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

579
39:05.700 --> 39:11.820
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

580
39:12.500 --> 39:16.260
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

581
39:16.460 --> 39:19.460
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

582
39:19.740 --> 39:24.500
♪I'll guard my princess, and keep her tears at bay♪

583
39:36.900 --> 39:42.420
My lady? My lady?

584
39:42.420 --> 39:45.220
My lady? My lady?

585
39:45.220 --> 39:46.460
(We've wasted too much time here.)

586
39:46.460 --> 39:47.380
(Everyone, search carefully!)

587
39:47.620 --> 39:48.380
(My lady?)

588
39:48.380 --> 39:49.340
- (Search carefully!) - (My lady?)

589
39:49.780 --> 39:50.580
(My lady?)

590
39:50.820 --> 39:51.980
(A few of you, come check over there with me!)

591
39:51.980 --> 39:53.420
(My lady? My lady?)

592
39:56.700 --> 39:57.580
(My lady?)

593
40:30.700 --> 40:31.420
(My lady?)

594
40:33.620 --> 40:34.860
- (My lady?) - (Can you hear us?)

595
40:34.860 --> 40:35.780
(Have you searched over there?)

596
40:35.900 --> 40:36.940
(My lady?)

597
40:38.020 --> 40:38.900
(Check over there!)

598
40:43.660 --> 40:44.540
(My lady?)

599
40:45.860 --> 40:46.780
(My lady?)

600
40:46.780 --> 40:47.220
(No sign of her here!)

601
40:49.620 --> 40:50.700
(My lady?)

602
40:51.180 --> 40:51.980
I'm here!

603
40:51.980 --> 40:54.860
My lady? My lady?

604
40:54.860 --> 40:55.980
I'm here!

605
40:56.820 --> 40:57.420
(What about over there?)

606
40:57.900 --> 40:58.740
(No sign of her here!)

607
40:58.820 --> 40:59.460
